{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_bdrk_tuhyqqgboe2xvvhwcmm67al5ynrfaw2b5eeexnzvbcjx6egniroq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01NKpEEsQMquLPMMurFLTPR9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cp src/lib.rs $TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak\nrun_mut() {\n  timeout 600 cargo build --lib -q 2>/dev/null\n  log=$(timeout 600 cargo test 2>&1)\n  p=$(echo \"$log\" | grep -oE '[0-9]+ passed' | grep -oE '[0-9]+' | paste -sd+ | bc)\n  f=$(echo \"$log\" | grep -oE '[0-9]+ failed' | grep -oE '[0-9]+' | paste -sd+ | bc)\n  names=$(echo \"$log\" | grep -E '^test .* FAILED' | sed 's/^test //;s/ \\.\\.\\..*//' | sort | head -6 | paste -sd, )\n  printf '  MUTANT[%-34s] passed=%-3s failed=%-3s %s\\n' \"$1\" \"${p:-?}\" \"${f:-?}\" \"$names\"\n}\nrun_mut \"baseline (unmutated)\"\n\npython3 -c \"\ns=open('src/lib.rs').read()\ns=s.replace('mulss(0.82944301379913f32, G)','mulss(f32::from_bits(0.82944301379913f32.to_bits()+1), G)',1)\nopen('src/lib.rs','w').write(s)\"\nrun_mut \"M1 constant off by 1 ULP\"\ncp $TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak src/lib.rs\n\npython3 -c \"\ns=open('src/lib.rs').read()\ni=s.index('let t_b = mulss(2.91188E-9f32, B);')\ns=s[:i]+s[i:].replace('addss(t_b, s1)','addss(s1, t_b)',1)\nopen('src/lib.rs','w').write(s)\"\nrun_mut \"M2 NaN dest/src order swapped\"\ncp $TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak src/lib.rs\n\npython3 -c \"\ns=open('src/lib.rs').read()\ns=s.replace('.read_unaligned()','.read()').replace('write_unaligned(','write(')\nopen('src/lib.rs','w').write(s)\"\nrun_mut \"M3 alignment-assuming deref\"\ncp $TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak src/lib.rs\n\npython3 -c \"\ns=open('src/lib.rs').read()\ns=s.replace('        _ => {}','        _ => unsafe { Protanopia(R, G, B) },',1)\nopen('src/lib.rs','w').write(s)\"\nrun_mut \"M4 switch default arm added\"\ncp $TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak src/lib.rs\n\npython3 -c \"\ns=open('src/lib.rs').read()\ns=s.replace('''    let (R, G, B) = unsafe {\n        (\n            Red.read_unaligned(),\n            Green.read_unaligned(),\n            Blue.read_unaligned(),\n        )\n    };''','    let (R, G, B) = unsafe { (Red.read_unaligned(), Green.read_unaligned(), Blue.read_unaligned()) };',1)\ns=s.replace('''    unsafe {\n        Red.write_unaligned(red);\n        Green.write_unaligned(green);\n        Blue.write_unaligned(blue);\n    }''','''    unsafe { Red.write_unaligned(red); }\n    let (R2, G2, B2) = unsafe { (Red.read_unaligned(), Green.read_unaligned(), Blue.read_unaligned()) };\n    let _ = (R2, G2, B2);\n    unsafe { Green.write_unaligned(green); Blue.write_unaligned(blue); }''',1)\nopen('src/lib.rs','w').write(s)\"\nrun_mut \"M5 (no-op restructure, control)\"\ncp $TMPDIR/lib.rs.bak src/lib.rs\nrun_mut \"restored\"","description":"Mutation-test the harness with correct result aggregation"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":758,"cache_read_input_tokens":128540,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":758,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7721d2ca-c5d4-46f5-9b61-8d143d83a75e","uuid":"4f529b86-8af1-4ef3-bc18-d46589631b80","timestamp":"2026-08-19T11:17:12.205Z"}
